  "idea": "Airtable interface designer for managing team project capacity",
  "text": "The simple no-code interface trick that replaced Jira and Asana for our team. Complex enterprise project management tools overwhelm creative agencies with hundreds of unnecessary settings and custom configurations. Confusing software creates low adoption rates, leaving team members logging tasks inconsistently and missing crucial sprint deadlines. Instead, build a streamlined Airtable Interface that displays only assigned tasks and active project milestones. Your team delivers client work on schedule.",
